      "side": 1,
      "message": "My concern is that this is hard-coded in the middle of the build file.\n\nWho is changing it once we branch into, say, android16-6.12-2025-02 where we should use a different profile?\n\nThe branch name has a single location already, https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/common/+/refs/heads/android15-6.6/build.config.common#5, but in practice it is not update for release branches as there were no users. Now with users we could update this single location. But I rather have that updated (and referred to from) build.config.common instead of line 272 in BUILD.bazel.",
